              "body": "<span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Hello, and welcome to Roblox—a platform for people all over the world to connect, share experiences, and express themselves in immersive digital environments, all made by users just like you.</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Before you jump in and start exploring, here are a few tips:</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">A safe, kind, and positive community is our top priority. To ensure you have the best possible experience, configure your </span></font></span><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/my/account#!/security\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><strong>security and privacy settings </strong></span></font></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">and be sure to review our </span></font></span><a href=\"https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/203313410\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><strong>rules and account safety tips</strong></span></font></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">.</span></font></span></p>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">There are endless ways to </span></font></span><a href=\"https://en.help.roblox.com/hc/en-us/articles/203313600\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><strong>customize your avatar </strong></span></font></span></a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">with accessories, faces, emotes, and more. After you’ve set up your avatar, check out some of the </span></font></span><span style=\"color:#1155cc\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/charts#/sortName/Most_engaging_V4?country=all&amp;device=computer\">most popular experiences</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/?SortFilter=1&amp;TimeFilter=0&amp;GenreFilter=1#/sortName/PopularInCountry\"></a></strong></span></font></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">from the community!</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Roblox is even better with friends. You can chat with them or invite them into your sessions at any time, even if they’re accessing Roblox on a different device than yours.&#160;</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">That’s all there is to it. Enjoy!</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Sincerely,</span></font></span>\r<br />\r<br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial\">Builderman, CEO of Roblox</span></font></span>",
